Wolf could not moderate himself any longer. By a single jump he overcame the distance between him and the woman, grabbed her basket and galloped into the forest. Mother was still standing on the road, holding a pot of butter.
It took Wolf a few seconds to empty the basket, but retribution was imminent. Sitting under the bush, suffering from diarrhea and disappointment, Wolf was cursing muddle-headed housewives. Today he won't harm anyone.  